sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API as API Layer
    participant Booking as Booking Module
    participant Search as Search Module
    participant Payment as Payment Module
    participant Provider as Provider Integration
    participant DB as Persistence Layer
    participant Notify as Notification Module

    Customer->>API: Submit booking request with offer reference
    API->>Booking: Start booking orchestration
    Booking->>Search: Load offer context
    Search-->>Booking: Offer snapshot and provider reference

    Booking->>Provider: Revalidate offer
    Provider-->>Booking: Current price and availability

    alt Offer invalid or changed
        Booking-->>API: Revalidation failure or updated offer
        API-->>Customer: Booking cannot continue
    else Offer valid
        Booking->>DB: Create pending booking
        DB-->>Booking: Booking reference

        Booking->>Payment: Authorize or capture payment
        Payment-->>Booking: Payment result

        alt Payment failed
            Booking->>DB: Mark booking as payment failed
            Booking-->>API: Payment failure
            API-->>Customer: Payment failed
        else Payment successful
            Booking->>Provider: Confirm reservation
            Provider-->>Booking: Provider confirmation result

            alt Provider confirmation failed
                Booking->>Payment: Initiate refund or void
                Payment-->>Booking: Compensation accepted
                Booking->>DB: Mark booking as failed
                Booking-->>API: Provider confirmation failure
                API-->>Customer: Booking failed
            else Provider confirmed
                Booking->>DB: Store confirmation and mark confirmed
                Booking-->>API: Confirmed booking
                API-->>Customer: Booking confirmed
                Booking-->>Notify: Publish booking confirmed event
                Notify-->>Customer: Confirmation notification
            end
        end
    end
